  <name>Abstrakt Deck</name>
  <summary>Audio-reactive kaleidoscope visualizer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Abstrakt Deck is a native audio-reactive kaleidoscope visualizer. It
      captures live audio input and renders GPU-accelerated kaleidoscopic scenes
      that react to the sound in real time.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time audio capture with FFT analysis</li>
      <li>GPU rendering with wgpu across multiple 3D shapes and painters</li>
      <li>Configurable kaleidoscope folds, zoom, rotation, color harmonies and overlays</li>
      <li>MIDI control input and savable presets</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
